---
const rows = [
  {
    topic: 'Sphere-packing exponent',
    before: 'Δ_d ≤ 2^(−0.59905576…d)  (Kabatianskii–Levenshtein)',
    after: 'Δ_d ≤ 2^(−(0.6044…+o(1))d), and the LP can do no better',
    since: 'unimproved since 1978'
  },
  {
    topic: 'Binary code rate',
    before: 'optimized MRRW exponent, for each fixed δ ∈ (0, 1/2)',
    after: 'strictly below MRRW at every such δ',
    since: 'unimproved since 1977'
  },
  {
    topic: 'Multicolor Ramsey',
    before: 'R_k(3) ≥ 380^(k/5) − O(1)  (exponential)',
    after: 'R_k(3) ≥ (ck^(1/3)/log k)^k, so R_k(3) = k^Θ(k)',
    since: 'question posed by 1990'
  },
  {
    topic: 'Ehrhart volume',
    before: 'vol(K) ≤ 4^n e^(−cn)',
    after: 'vol(K) ≤ (n+1)^n/n!, the sharp bound',
    since: 'conjectured 1964'
  },
  {
    topic: 'Entangled parallel repetition',
    before: 'polynomial decay in general; exponential only for anchored games',
    after: 'exponential decay for every finite two-player entangled game',
    since: 'open since Raz 1995'
  },
  {
    topic: 'Closest vector hardness',
    before: 'polynomial factors via the PCP theorem',
    after: 'n^(1/400) by a direct 3SAT reduction, no PCP theorem',
    since: 'new proof route'
  }
]
---

<figure class="viz bound-ledger" aria-labelledby="tenadv-ledger-title">
  <figcaption id="tenadv-ledger-title">
    <strong>What actually moved</strong>
    <span
      >Six of the ten chapters replace a specific published bound. The previous entry in each row is
      the standing record, not a strawman.</span
    >
  </figcaption>

  <div class="axis-panel">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 360 96" role="img" aria-labelledby="tenadv-axis-title">
      <title id="tenadv-axis-title">
        The sphere-packing exponent moves from 0.599 to 0.6044 on a narrow axis
      </title>
      <path class="axis" d="M30 62h300"></path>
      <path class="tick" d="M30 56v12"></path>
      <path class="tick" d="M330 56v12"></path>
      <text class="tick-label" x="30" y="82">0.598</text>
      <text class="tick-label" x="330" y="82" text-anchor="end">0.606</text>

      <path class="marker old" d="M101 30v32"></path>
      <circle class="dot" cx="101" cy="62" r="3.5"></circle>
      <text class="pt" x="101" y="24" text-anchor="middle">0.59906 (1978)</text>

      <path class="marker new" d="M270 30v32"></path>
      <circle class="dot" cx="270" cy="62" r="3.5"></circle>
      <text class="pt strongtext" x="270" y="24" text-anchor="middle">0.6044 (2026)</text>
    </svg>
    <span class="scale-note"
      >Exponent α in Δ_d ≤ 2^(−αd). A larger α is a stronger bound; the gain compounds with
      dimension.</span
    >
  </div>

  <dl class="ledger">
    {
      rows.map((r) => (
        <div class="entry">
          <dt>
            {r.topic}
            <em>{r.since}</em>
          </dt>
          <dd class="before">
            <span>previous</span>
            {r.before}
          </dd>
          <dd class="after">
            <span>this paper</span>
            {r.after}
          </dd>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </dl>
</figure>

<style>
  .viz {
    container-type: inline-size;
    margin: 2em 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--astro-code-background);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  figcaption {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
  }
  figcaption strong {
    font: 600 var(--font-size-s) var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  figcaption span {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font: 0.7rem/1.5 var(--mono);
  }
  .axis-panel {
    padding: 0.85rem 0.75rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg);
  }
  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
  }
  path {
    fill: none;
    vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
  }
  .axis,
  .tick {
    stroke: var(--border);
  }
  .marker {
    stroke: var(--text-tertiary);
    stroke-dasharray: 3 4;
  }
  .marker.new {
    stroke: var(--text-primary);
    stroke-dasharray: none;
  }
  .dot {
    fill: var(--text-primary);
  }
  text {
    fill: var(--text-secondary);
    font: 0.66rem var(--mono);
  }
  .tick-label {
    fill: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
  }
  .strongtext {
    fill: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .scale-note {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font: 0.62rem/1.5 var(--mono);
  }
  .ledger {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
    margin: 1.1rem 0 0;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .entry {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  dt {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    margin: 0;
    font: 600 0.8rem/1.35 var(--sans);
  }
  dt em {
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font: 0.62rem/1.4 var(--mono);
    font-style: normal;
  }
  dd {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.28rem;
    margin: 0;
    min-width: 0;
    font: 0.68rem/1.55 var(--mono);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  dd span {
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .before {
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }
  .after {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    padding-left: 0.6rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--text-secondary);
  }
  @container (max-width: 640px) {
    .entry {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      row-gap: 0.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
